WEBVTT

00:32:58.840 --> 00:33:01.346
When Carmen tried
to voice her authentic ideas,

00:33:01.370 --> 00:33:04.146
she hadn't accumulated
enough idiosyncrasy credit

00:33:04.170 --> 00:33:06.371
to fight the status quo at the CIA.

00:33:07.093 --> 00:33:08.620
In order to turn things around,

00:33:08.644 --> 00:33:11.448
Carmen had to show
that she was dedicated to the mission.

00:33:12.180 --> 00:33:14.084
One day, she came across a CIA role

00:33:14.108 --> 00:33:17.463
focused on keeping classified
publications secure,

00:33:17.487 --> 00:33:18.739
one she could excel at.

00:33:19.343 --> 00:33:20.712
CM: And I went, "That's it!

00:33:20.736 --> 00:33:25.999
If I can just perform the other duties
really, really well,

00:33:26.023 --> 00:33:31.366
then maybe I will get a chance to explore
what's really my passion."